{"qid": "con_00001", "category": "concept", "bucket": "b1", "method": "legalgate", "seed": 0, "split": "test", "turn_id": 0, "group_id": null, "gold_pass": null, "correct": false, "retrieval_used": false, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "latency_ms": 15103.9, "n_tokens": 125, "u": -3.374865, "tau_b": 0.1, "tau": null, "channel": "A", "tvc": null, "case_pass": null, "invalid_law_cited": false, "invalid_laws": [], "cited_golden": false, "key_recall": 0.2222222222222222, "refusal": false, "uncertain": false, "answer_len": 217, "slots_inherited_ok": null, "score_detail": "key_recall=0.22 (>=0.40) refusal=False", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条规定：“夫妻一方要求离婚的，可以由有关组织进行调解或者直接向人民法院提起离婚诉讼。”第二百一十一条规定：“夫妻分居两地分别管理、使用的房屋，双方协商一致就确实无法联系中的一方财产归属问题达成书面协议的，协议有效，但当事人另有约定影响该协议效力的除外。”因此，夫妻双方共同生活期间所得的财产属于夫妻共同财产，应当平等地分割；一方因个人原因未实际居住而另一方请求分割的，应当认定为夫妻共同财产。", "trace": {"channel": "A", "u": -3.374865, "tau_b": 0.1, "bucket": "b1", "slots": {"law_short": null, "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": "离婚纠纷", "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}, "slots_inherited": [], "validity_status": null, "case_verify": null, "source_url": null, "decision": "u=-3.3749 <= tau_b1=0.1 → A", "latency_ms": 15102.1, "n_retrieval_calls": 0, "signal": "margin", "k_draft": 20, "intent": {"hit_provision": false, "hit_case_no": false, "slots_complete": false, "route_b_reason": "", "slots": {"law_short": null, "article_no": null, "paragraph_no": null, "item_no": null, "case_no_raw": null, "topic": "离婚纠纷", "temporal_query": false, "law_validity_query": false, "provision_seeking": false, "inherited": []}}, "retrieval": null, "llm_backend": "hf", "draft_text": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一千零七十九条规定：“夫妻一方要求离婚的"}}
